---
import CV from "../assets/cv/CV_NICOLAS_ROZAS.pdf";
import DownloadSVG from "../assets/svg/download.svg";
---

<section class="border-t border-t-slate-200 pt-4 grid grid-cols-1">
    <div
        class="bg-gray-900 border-cyan-300 border rounded-2xl mx-4 md:mx-40 text-center justify-center items-center"
    >
        <h2 class="uppercase text-sm md:text-lg font-semibold text-cyan-300 pt-2 px-2">
            Contacto
        </h2>
        <h1 class="text-lg md:text-2xl text-slate-200">¿Deseas Contactarme?</h1>
        <p class="text-balance font-medium text-slate-300 italic p-2 text-xs leading-relaxed md:text-base">
            Estoy abierto a nuevas oportunidades laborales, para poder seguir
            adquiriendo experiencia, ya sea como Junior o Trainee.
            <br />
            A continuación, adjunto mi CV y mis redes sociales.
        </p>
        <div
            class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 mx-1 md:mx-8 p-2 gap-2 md:gap-x-2 justify-center items-center text-center text-xs md:text-sm"
        >
            <a
                href={CV}
                download="CV_NICOLAS_ROZAS.pdf"
                class="bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 font-bold border border-cyan-400 p-2 rounded-2xl duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:bg-cyan-300 flex justify-center items-center"
            >
                CV <DownloadSVG class="size-4 md:size-5"/>
            </a>

            <a
                href="mailto:nicorozas6694@gmail.com"
                class="text-[10px] border border-cyan-400 text-cyan-400 p-2 rounded-2xl duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:bg-cyan-400/10 hover:text-white flex justify-center items-center"
            >
                nicorozas6694@gmail.com
            </a>

            <a
                href="https://github.com/nicorp12"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer noopener"
                class="border border-cyan-400 text-cyan-400 p-2 rounded-2xl duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:bg-cyan-400/10 hover:text-white flex justify-center items-center"
            >
                GitHub
            </a>

            <a
                href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nicorozasp/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer noopener"
                class="border border-cyan-400 text-cyan-400 p-2 rounded-2xl duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:bg-cyan-400/10 hover:text-white flex justify-center items-center"
            >
                LinkedIn
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
